<h1>Luma</h1>
<p>Control your Govee lights from iPhone, iPad, and Apple Watch. Build scenes, set schedules, and make lights follow the colors of a TV or monitor using the camera.</p>
<p>Luma is an experimental, open-source project by Design X Develop LLC. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Govee. "Govee" is a trademark of its owner.</p>
<p>No lights or account? Open the app and tap <b>Explore Demo</b>.</p>
